Watch expressions
  ok      watching an elementary numeric item shows its value
  ok      watching an alphanumeric item shows its text
  ok      watching an unknown name reports it cannot be evaluated
  BUG?    watching a subordinate item shows its value
            -> REC-ID: expected 42, got "Failed to evaluate REC-ID"
  BUG?    watching a qualified item shows its value
            -> REC-ID OF REC: expected 42, got "Failed to evaluate REC-ID OF REC"
  BUG?    watching a table element shows its value
            -> ITEM (2): expected 7, got "Failed to evaluate ITEM (2)"
  BUG?    watching a binary (COMP) item shows its value
            -> C: expected 77, got "Failed to evaluate C"
  BUG?    watching an arithmetic expression computes it
            -> N + 1 (N = 5): expected 6, got "\"00051\""
  BUG?    watching a numeric item shows a number, not its raw storage
            -> N: got "\"0005\""
